message: "If you use this software or the underlying methodology in your research, please cite both the software and the accompanying ICIS 2024 paper."
title: "PERISCOPE Navigator: A Recommender System for Privacy-Friendly Platform Business Models"
abstract: "The Privacy-friendly Business Model Recommender (PERISCOPE Navigator) supports platform businesses in evaluating and optimizing their privacy-friendliness score from a consumer perspective based on empirical conjoint experiment data."
